{"kind": "mod", "id": 1945, "name": "Ai Limit", "slug": "ai-limit", "teaser": "Temporarily disable far bots to reduce cpu load", "owner_name": "wizard83", "downloads": 59484, "favourites": 41, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": "com.dvize.ailimit", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Bots", "category_id": 5, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T06:08:41.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-01-06T10:28:40.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-01-06T10:28:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "latest_version": "1.8.6", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<p>For more FPS you can try NVidia Smooth motion with NVidia GPU RTX 4000+</p>\n<p>Disable AI (temporarily) based on distance to the player and user defined bot limit within that distance. Only the closest bots (distance wise) are enabled based on a max value you set in bepinex config.</p>\n<p>For instance, i could set the AI Distance limit to 400 and the bot limit to 5.</p>\n<p>Within that max distance of 400, my version will only enable the closest 5 bots.</p>\n<p>Once you kill the bots close to you, it could activate bots up to your maximum much further away.</p>\n<p>Don’t use this mod with Questing Bots.<br />\nQuesting Bots have their own AI Limiter.</p>\n<p>Original mod <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/793-ai-limit/?highlight=ai%20li#overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AI Limit</a></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.8.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 4596, "published_at": "2025-01-09T08:17:04.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1945/ai-limit/1.8.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.8.3", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads"